# Garment Manufacturing CV - local config/data (camera credentials, drawn zones, test clips, the
# Phase 6 database)
garment_cv/configs/.env
garment_cv/configs/zones.json
garment_cv/configs/zones.tmp
garment_cv/configs/garment.db
garment_cv/media/
garment_cv/tests/_*.mp4
# ...but DO commit the real test photo several tests depend on (cv2.imread'd, not generated) -
# the blanket *.jpg/*.png/*.mp4 rules above are meant for runtime snapshots/captures, not fixtures
!garment_cv/tests/assets/*.jpg
# Synthetic training pipeline (proof of concept, not real training data - see
# garment_cv/training/README.md): the dataset and demo weight are both cheap and fast to
# regenerate (`make_synthetic_dataset.py` then `train_synthetic.py`, seconds not hours), unlike
# phase14_ppe's real trained model below - so neither is tracked here.
garment_cv/training/datasets/
garment_cv/models/*
# ...except the trained live-demo model (marking/cutting/pen). It cannot be auto-downloaded and retraining
# takes hours plus hand-labelled data, so - like phase14_ppe/models/ppe.pt - it IS tracked (5.5 MB).
!garment_cv/models/live_demo.pt

# Marketing videos: scripts are tracked, rendered videos/stock footage are not (see garment_cv/marketing/README.md).
# The company logo the video scripts load is small and needed, so it is tracked.
!garment_cv/marketing/explainer_video/srikesh_logo.png
